#: ../../get_start/window/window.rst:32
msgid ""
"``+`` and ``-`` combine fields. ``*`` between two fields forms their "
"local coefficient-space product; ``*`` with a scalar rescales a field. "
"The result is another ``SFCField`` marked as a derived field."
