#: ../../get_start/window/window.rst:144
msgid "Use the task layer when appropriate"
msgstr ""

#: ../../get_start/window/window.rst:146
msgid ""
"Direct operations are ideal for understanding an estimator, constructing "
"a new physical field, or prototyping a custom statistic. For production "
"Counting, 2PCF, and 3PCF runs, task classes also manage data/random "
"fields, sampling grids, MPI distribution, dependencies among output "
"products, and metadata. Low-level and high-level paths use the same "
"field/window machinery."
msgstr ""

